import scr "acme.example/screening"

flow Dotted
note """
The CROSS-MODULE IMPORT fixture. Its `use` names a flow in the sibling module
under other/, which is the reference ticket step (4) asks the smoke to resolve
and activate through the loader. The assembler follow-up resolves it through
Packages.ResolveFlow into the same by-name binding a local `use` gets, so what
the smoke observes here is a program that RUNS with a datum crossing the
imported flow.
"""
on error Alert
source ingest Feed()
use screen scr.Screen from ingest -> ok, bad
sink emit Report from ok
drop bad
